  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> are square matrices of same order and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math> is an identity matrix of the same order, such that <math><msup><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given,<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math>"
  }
